Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:02.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}What if Venom took over Superman?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.60,0:00:04.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}His blue suit… turns black.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.80,0:00:05.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.50,0:00:07.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}The symbiote makes every power stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.80,0:00:09.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}And he was already faster than a bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.80,0:00:11.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}He doesn't save the city anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.40,0:00:12.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}He hunts it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.30,0:00:14.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Even kryptonite might not reach him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.70,0:00:17.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}But the symbiote has two weaknesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:18.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Sound… and fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.60,0:00:20.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}And Superman carries both.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.10,0:00:21.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Heat vision is fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.30,0:00:23.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}One clap is a sonic boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:25.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}It chose the one body it can't survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.80,0:00:31.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Superman's first comic, from 1938, sold for six million dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:33.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}So… who would win?
